WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.441 --> 00:00:04.297
Unit three. Online Safety Rules!

2
00:00:05.248 --> 00:00:09.681
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.731 --> 00:00:12.624
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.674 --> 00:00:16.670
Today we learn about Online Safety Rules. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.629 --> 00:00:23.783
Personal information. Say it with me. Personal information!

6
00:00:27.321 --> 00:00:31.821
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

7
00:00:35.262 --> 00:00:39.796
Safe website. Say it with me. Safe website!

8
00:00:43.374 --> 00:00:47.438
Report. Say it with me. Report!

9
00:00:50.919 --> 00:00:55.516
Uncomfortable. Say it with me. Uncomfortable!

10
00:00:58.994 --> 00:01:03.494
Kind words. Say it with me. Kind words!

11
00:01:07.003 --> 00:01:10.694
Rule. Say it with me. Rule!

12
00:01:14.192 --> 00:01:17.875
Protect. Say it with me. Protect!

13
00:01:21.368 --> 00:01:36.590
I never share personal information like my address online. If something feels uncomfortable, I tell a trusted adult and report it. Visiting a safe website and using kind words helps protect everyone online.

14
00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:40.028
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:40.776 --> 00:01:46.229
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:46.279 --> 00:01:47.737
Safe website!

17
00:01:48.943 --> 00:01:54.579
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:54.629 --> 00:01:55.779
Rule!

19
00:01:56.588 --> 00:02:03.925
Did you know? Many websites for kids are specially checked by adults to make sure they are safe to visit!

20
00:02:03.975 --> 00:02:06.332
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:16.337
Think and answer. What personal information should you never share online?

22
00:02:16.387 --> 00:02:17.537
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.549 --> 00:02:24.506
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:24.556 --> 00:02:27.804
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

